In the new version of Nethack, you can step in water, and still be
able to struggle to the other side.  I f you are weighted down, you
will drop some of your stuff (no choice) and struggle out. (note:  If
you were forced to drop some stuff because you accidentally stepped in
a pool, you can kick the spot and sen it flying out) Anyway, to avoid
losing stuff, throw it all across the moat, then step into the moat.

WARNING:  When I did it, all the squares around were free, the first
time, and the second and third time (I did it deliberately, searching
for the book of the dead by the wizard's castle) I may have just
gotten lucky, but I do believe this works everytime.

Also, if you have anything on you, it will be rusted, blanked, or
diluted if possible.


